#: alarmmanager_admin.php:50
msgid "The administration action succeeded."
msgstr "Igikorwa cy'ubuyobozi cyagenze neza."

#: alarmmanager_admin.php:86
msgid "Administration unavailable or permission denied."
msgstr "Ubuyobozi ntibuboneka cyangwa uruhushya rwahakanwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:78
msgid "Choose the alarm information to send to any service. Use Combined text to arrange device details, or Use device message to start with a complete message. Email uses Subject and Message; API destinations use the field names required by the receiving service."
msgstr "Hitamo amakuru y'impuruza yo kohereza kuri serivisi iyo ari yo yose. Koresha Umwandiko uhujwe kugira ngo utunganye amakuru y'igikoresho, cyangwa Koresha ubutumwa bw'igikoresho kugira ngo utangire n'ubutumwa bwuzuye. Imeyili ikoresha Umutwe n'Ubutumwa; ibyerekezo bya API bikoresha amazina y'imirima asabwa na serivisi yakira."

#: includes/admin_view.php:79
msgid "Advanced message configuration"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rihanitse ry'ubutumwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:90
msgid "New endpoint"
msgstr "Iherezo rishya ry'umuyoboro"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Custom integration"
msgstr "Ihuzwa ryihariye"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Integration provider"
msgstr "Utanga ihuzwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "API Key SID and Secret (recommended)"
msgstr "API Key SID n'Ibanga (birasabwa)"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Account SID and Auth Token"
msgstr "Account SID na Tokeni yo Kwemeza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Twilio credentials"
msgstr "Imyirondoro ya Twilio"

#: includes/admin_view.php:113
msgid "Send using"
msgstr "Ohereza ukoresheje"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Icyabaye"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Incident"
msgstr "Ikibazo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "ServiceNow record type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bw'inyandiko ya ServiceNow"

#: includes/admin_view.php:126
msgid "Changing the record type replaces the destination table, message fields and recovery settings with its defaults. Your instance and credentials are retained."
msgstr "Guhindura ubwoko bw'inyandiko bisimbuza imbonerahamwe y'ikerekezo, imirima y'ubutumwa n'igenamiterere ryo gusubira ku murongo ibyayo bisanzwe. Urugero rwawe n'imyirondoro biragumaho."

#: includes/admin_view.php:149
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Icyerekezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:154
msgid "Email settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'imeyili"

#: includes/admin_view.php:161
msgid "Delivery uses the Cacti mail settings. Add the people who should receive these alarms."
msgstr "Iyohereza rikoresha igenamiterere ry'imeyili rya Cacti. Ongeraho abantu bagomba kwakira izi mpuruza."

#: includes/admin_view.php:162
msgid "Script settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya skripti"

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "JSON output is sent to the script on standard input."
msgstr "Ibisohoka bya JSON byoherezwa kuri skripti ku bwinjizwa busanzwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "The executable must exist and be executable by the worker on every delivering poller. Arguments are passed directly without a shell."
msgstr "Porogaramu ikora igomba kuba ihari kandi ishobora gukoreshwa n'umukozi kuri buri poller yohereza. Ibikurikira bitangwa mu buryo butaziguye nta shell."

#: includes/admin_view.php:169
msgid "WebSocket delivery is not implemented."
msgstr "Iyohereza rya WebSocket ntirirashyirwa mu bikorwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:171
msgid "Advanced delivery settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rihanitse ryo kohereza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:176
msgid "Connection options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo guhuza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:179
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Uburyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:186
msgid "Certificate and hostname verification remain enabled. Provision the PEM file on every poller. Saved credentials are never displayed."
msgstr "Igenzura ry'icyemezo n'izina ry'umwakiri rikomeza gukora. Shyira dosiye ya PEM kuri buri poller. Imyirondoro yabitswe ntigaragara na rimwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:187
msgid "Other delivery options"
msgstr "Andi mahitamo yo kohereza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189 includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Hagarika"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189
msgid "Test destination saves the current settings and queues a sample alarm for this destination. Enable the destination before testing."
msgstr "Gerageza ikerekezo ibika igenamiterere ririho kandi igashyira impuruza y'urugero ku murongo w'iki kerekezo. Fungura ikerekezo mbere yo kugerageza."

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Save endpoint"
msgstr "Bika iherezo ry'umuyoboro"

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Test destination"
msgstr "Gerageza ikerekezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete endpoint"
msgstr "Siba iherezo ry'umuyoboro"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete this endpoint, its delivery settings and saved credentials"
msgstr "Siba iri herezo ry'umuyoboro, igenamiterere ryaryo ryo kohereza n'imyirondoro yabitswe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Deleting stops future delivery and removes the saved settings and credentials. Remove notification rule references and resolve queued or running deliveries first. Completed and failed delivery history is preserved."
msgstr "Gusiba bihagarika iyohereza ry'ejo hazaza kandi bigakuraho igenamiterere n'imyirondoro yabitswe. Kuraho amareferansi y'amategeko y'imenyesha kandi ukemure iyohereza riri ku murongo cyangwa riri gukorwa mbere. Amateka y'iyohereza ryarangiye n'iryanze aragumaho."

#: includes/admin_view.php:205
msgid "Chat and messaging"
msgstr "Ibicaniro n'ubutumwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:206
msgid "Post alarms to a Slack channel."
msgstr "Ohereza impuruza ku muyoboro wa Slack."

#: includes/admin_view.php:207
msgid "Post alarm cards through a Teams Workflow."
msgstr "Ohereza amakarita y'impuruza binyuze muri Teams Workflow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:208
msgid "Send alarms from a Telegram bot."
msgstr "Ohereza impuruza uvuye kuri boti ya Telegram."

#: includes/admin_view.php:209
msgid "Text alarms to phone numbers."
msgstr "Ohereza impuruza z'ubutumwa bugufi kuri nimero za telefoni."

#: includes/admin_view.php:210
msgid "Send approved WhatsApp templates."
msgstr "Ohereza inyandikorugero za WhatsApp zemejwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:211
msgid "Incident management"
msgstr "Gucunga ibibazo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:212
msgid "Trigger and resolve PagerDuty incidents."
msgstr "Tangiza kandi ukemure ibibazo bya PagerDuty."

#: includes/admin_view.php:213
msgid "Open and resolve ServiceNow incidents or events."
msgstr "Fungura kandi ukemure ibibazo cyangwa ibyabaye bya ServiceNow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:214
msgid "Network management"
msgstr "Gucunga urusobe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:215
msgid "Send SNMPv2c or SNMPv3 traps and INFORMs."
msgstr "Ohereza imitego ya SNMPv2c cyangwa SNMPv3 na INFORM."

#: includes/admin_view.php:216
msgid "Forward RFC 5424 or RFC 3164 messages over UDP, TCP or TLS."
msgstr "Ohereza ubutumwa bwa RFC 5424 cyangwa RFC 3164 ukoresheje UDP, TCP cyangwa TLS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:217
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Byihariye"

#: includes/admin_view.php:218
msgid "Start from an empty endpoint."
msgstr "Tangirira ku iherezo ry'umuyoboro ririmo ubusa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:219
msgid "POST alarm JSON to any HTTPS endpoint."
msgstr "Ohereza JSON y'impuruza ukoresheje POST ku iherezo iryo ari ryo ryose rya HTTPS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:220
msgid "Call an API with your own method, authentication and response checks."
msgstr "Hamagara API ukoresheje uburyo bwawe, kwemeza umwirondoro n'igenzura ry'ibisubizo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:221
msgid "Run a local executable with the alarm as JSON input."
msgstr "Koresha porogaramu y'imbere ikora hamwe n'impuruza nk'ibinjizwa bya JSON."

#: includes/admin_view.php:227
msgid "Add integration"
msgstr "Ongeraho ihuzwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Choose a template. It opens as a disabled draft; nothing is sent until you enable it."
msgstr "Hitamo inyandikorugero. Ifunguka nk'inyandiko y'ibanze ihagaritswe; nta cyoherezwa kugeza igihe uyifunguriye."

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Search integrations"
msgstr "Shakisha amahuzwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:234
msgid "Blank endpoint"
msgstr "Iherezo ry'umuyoboro ririmo ubusa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:239
msgid "No integrations match your search."
msgstr "Nta mahuzwa ahuye n'ishakisha ryawe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:243
msgid "SNMP trap settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'umutego wa SNMP"

#: includes/admin_view.php:259
msgid "Saved community and passphrases are encrypted and never displayed. Leave them blank to keep the saved values; entering any value replaces all saved SNMP secrets."
msgstr "Umuryango n'interuro z'ibanga byabitswe bifunze mu ibanga kandi ntibigaragara na rimwe. Bisige ubusa kugira ngo ugumane uduciro twabitswe; kwinjiza agaciro ako ari ko kose bisimbuza amabanga yose ya SNMP yabitswe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:260
msgid "Traps are sent as Cacti's CACTI-MIB cactiNotify with the snmptrap binary from Cacti Settings > Paths on every delivering poller. Add one destination per receiver."
msgstr "Imitego yoherezwa nka CACTI-MIB cactiNotify ya Cacti hakoreshejwe dosiye ya snmptrap ivuye mu Igenamiterere rya Cacti > Inzira kuri buri poller yohereza. Ongeraho ikerekezo kimwe kuri buri wakira."

#: includes/admin_view.php:261
msgid "Syslog settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:269
msgid "TLS verifies the receiver certificate and hostname. Use port 6514 for TLS. UDP and TCP are unencrypted, and a UDP message is confirmed only as sent."
msgstr "TLS igenzura icyemezo cy'uwakira n'izina ry'umwakiri. Koresha umuryango 6514 kuri TLS. UDP na TCP ntibifunze mu ibanga, kandi ubutumwa bwa UDP bwemezwa gusa ko bwoherejwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:278 setup.php:191
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Iminsi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:283
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Isaha y'akarere"

#: includes/admin_view.php:291
msgid "Times use the selected timezone and the alarm event time. An end time before the start runs overnight. Equal times cover the entire selected day."
msgstr "Ibihe bikoresha isaha y'akarere yatoranyijwe n'igihe cy'icyabaye cy'impuruza. Igihe cyo kurangira mbere yo gutangira gikora ijoro ryose. Ibihe bingana bikubiyemo umunsi wose watoranyijwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:332 includes/admin_view.php:521
msgid "Create a rule"
msgstr "Kora itegeko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Byafunguwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "Icyihutirwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:334
msgid "Rule and destination"
msgstr "Itegeko n'ikerekezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:338
msgid "Alarm Destination"
msgstr "Aho impuruza yoherezwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:341
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "yahagaritswe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:343
msgid "Select one or more alarm destinations. Disabled destinations do not send alarms."
msgstr "Hitamo ikerekezo kimwe cyangwa byinshi by'impuruza. Ibyerekezo byahagaritswe ntibyohereza impuruza."

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Message template"
msgstr "Inyandikorugero y'ubutumwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Use each destination default, or customize its message for this rule. Customization starts with a copy of the destination template and does not change other rules. If several rules match the same destination, the first matching rule in priority and ID order supplies its template."
msgstr "Koresha ibisanzwe bya buri kerekezo, cyangwa uhindure ubutumwa bwacyo kuri iri tegeko. Guhindura bitangirira kuri kopi y'inyandikorugero y'ikerekezo kandi ntibihindura andi mategeko. Niba amategeko menshi ahuye n'ikerekezo kimwe, itegeko rya mbere rihuye mu rutonde rw'urwego na ID ritanga inyandikorugero yaryo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:352
msgid "Custom template"
msgstr "Inyandikorugero yihariye"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
msgid "Destination recipient"
msgstr "Uwakira w'ikerekezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
#, php-format
msgid "Recipients: %d"
msgstr "Abakira: %d"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Customize message for this rule"
msgstr "Hindura ubutumwa bw'iri tegeko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Unchecked: Use destination default."
msgstr "Itatoranyijwe: Koresha ibisanzwe by'ikerekezo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:361
msgid "Optional: add each phone number in international format, such as +15551234567. These numbers replace the destination recipient for this rule. Leave the list empty to use the destination default. Each number has its own delivery status and retries."
msgstr "Bitari itegeko: ongeraho buri nimero ya telefoni mu buryo mpuzamahanga, nka +15551234567. Izi nimero zisimbura uwakira w'ikerekezo kuri iri tegeko. Siga urutonde rurimo ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe ibisanzwe by'ikerekezo. Buri nimero ifite imiterere yayo yo kohereza n'ibigeragezo byo kongera."

#: includes/admin_view.php:374
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nta na kimwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Build device conditions using AND, OR and groups. These conditions use the current Cacti device settings and must also satisfy any alarm filters below. With no device conditions, all devices can match."
msgstr "Kora ibisabwa by'igikoresho ukoresheje AND, OR n'amatsinda. Ibi bisabwa bikoresha igenamiterere ririho ry'igikoresho cya Cacti kandi bigomba no kuzuza utuyunguruzo twose tw'impuruza hasi. Nta bisabwa by'igikoresho bihari, ibikoresho byose bishobora guhura."

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Match devices"
msgstr "Huza ibikoresho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"
msgstr "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Device Status"
msgstr "Imimerere y'igikoresho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Syslog"
msgstr "Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Thold"
msgstr "Thold"

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Build alarm conditions using AND, OR, NOT and groups. Alarms must also match the device conditions above."
msgstr "Kora ibisabwa by'impuruza ukoresheje AND, OR, NOT n'amatsinda. Impuruza zigomba kandi guhura n'ibisabwa by'igikoresho hejuru."

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Match alarms"
msgstr "Huza impuruza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:395
msgid "No alarm sources detected yet. Sources appear after their first alarm."
msgstr "Nta nkomoko z'impuruza ziraboneka. Inkomoko zigaragara nyuma y'impuruza yazo ya mbere."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "By default, matching alarms can notify at any time. Turn on a schedule to limit when this rule matches."
msgstr "Ubusanzwe, impuruza zihuye zishobora kumenyesha igihe icyo ari cyo cyose. Fungura gahunda y'igihe kugira ngo ugabanye igihe iri tegeko rihura."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "Notification hours"
msgstr "Amasaha yo kumenyesha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppress notifications"
msgstr "Hagarika amamenyesha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppressed alarms remain in history. Recovery notifications bypass acknowledgment, cooldown and duplicate suppression, but still follow notification hours and maintenance windows."
msgstr "Impuruza zahagaritswe ziguma mu mateka. Amamenyesha yo kugaruka ku murongo arenga kwemeza, igihe cyo gutuza no guhagarika ibyisubiramo, ariko akomeza gukurikiza amasaha yo kumenyesha n'amadirishya yo gusana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:403
msgid "Set a duration to 0 to turn it off."
msgstr "Shyira igihe kuri 0 kugira ngo ugihagarike."

#: includes/admin_view.php:405
msgid "Rule order"
msgstr "Urutonde rw'amategeko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Create rule"
msgstr "Kora itegeko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Rules with equal priority run in ID order. Stopping also applies when this rule suppresses notifications."
msgstr "Amategeko afite urwego rungana akora ukurikije urutonde rwa ID. Guhagarika bireba kandi igihe iri tegeko ribujije amamenyesha."

#: includes/admin_view.php:417
msgid "Configuration Backup/Restore"
msgstr "Kopi y'Ububiko/Kugarura Igenamiterere"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Byahagaritswe by'agateganyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Biri gukora"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "everything has been delivered"
msgstr "byose byoherejwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "oldest queued %s UTC"
msgstr "ishaje kurusha izindi ku murongo %s UTC"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "waiting messages"
msgstr "ubutumwa butegereje"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "Hide messages"
msgstr "Hisha ubutumwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "View messages"
msgstr "Reba ubutumwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Ahantu ho guhurira"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Ubutumwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Next try"
msgstr "Ikigeragezo gitaha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441 includes/reports.php:458
msgid "Queued"
msgstr "Biri ku murongo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Tries"
msgstr "Ibigeragezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:451
msgid "Times in UTC · first 100 shown"
msgstr "Ibihe muri UTC · 100 za mbere ziragaragara"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Pause delivery"
msgstr "Hagarika iyohereza by'agateganyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Resume delivery"
msgstr "Komeza iyohereza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Clear queue"
msgstr "Siba umurongo w'itegereza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:459
#, php-format
msgid "Discard all %d waiting notifications on this poller?"
msgstr "Jugunya amamenyesha yose %d ategereje kuri iyi poller?"

#: includes/admin_view.php:460
msgid "Includes retries. They stay in delivery history as failed, reason queue_cleared."
msgstr "Birimo n'ibigeragezo byo kongera. Biguma mu mateka y'iyohereza nk'ibyanze, impamvu queue_cleared."

#: includes/admin_view.php:461
msgid "Messages already sending and alarm state are kept."
msgstr "Ubutumwa buri koherezwa n'imiterere y'impuruza biragumaho."

#: includes/admin_view.php:462
msgid "Tip: pause delivery first during maintenance."
msgstr "Inama: hagarika iyohereza by'agateganyo mbere mu gihe cyo gusana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:463
msgid "Clear queue…"
msgstr "Guhagarika no gusiba umurongo…"

#: includes/admin_view.php:464
msgid "Controls apply to this poller. While paused, alarms are still received and queued; Resume sends them."
msgstr "Igenzura rireba iyi poller. Igihe bihagaritswe by'agateganyo, impuruza zikomeza kwakirwa no gushyirwa ku murongo; Komeza zirazohereza."

#: includes/admin_view.php:467
msgid "View delivery results"
msgstr "Reba ibisubizo byo kohereza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:470
msgid "Create an integration, configure its destination and credentials, test a sample alarm here, then select it directly in a rule."
msgstr "Kora ihuzwa, gena ikerekezo cyaryo n'imyirondoro, gerageza impuruza y'urugero hano, hanyuma urihitemo mu buryo butaziguye mu itegeko."

#: includes/admin_view.php:476
msgid "Configured integrations"
msgstr "Amahuzwa yagenwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:479
msgid "No integrations yet. Choose a template above to create one."
msgstr "Nta mahuzwa arahari. Hitamo inyandikorugero hejuru kugira ngo ukore rimwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Alarm Rules"
msgstr "Amategeko y'Impuruza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Choose which alarms should notify, where to send them and when to pause notifications. Rules run from lowest to highest priority."
msgstr "Hitamo impuruza zigomba kumenyesha, aho zoherezwa n'igihe cyo guhagarika amamenyesha by'agateganyo. Amategeko akora kuva ku rwego ruto kugeza ku rwego rwo hejuru."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create an integration before saving your first rule."
msgstr "Kora ihuzwa mbere yo kubika itegeko ryawe rya mbere."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create integration"
msgstr "Kora ihuzwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Siba"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "Bikomeye cyane"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Amakuru"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Major"
msgstr "Gikomeye"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Minor"
msgstr "Gito"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Occurrence"
msgstr "Kubaho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Raised"
msgstr "Byazamuwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Recovered"
msgstr "Byagarutse ku murongo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Reminder"
msgstr "Urwibutso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Updated"
msgstr "wavuguruwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Iburira"

#: includes/admin_view.php:520
msgid "Alarm notifications require an enabled matching Alarm Rule. Without one, alarms remain in history but no notifications are sent."
msgstr "Amamenyesha y'impuruza asaba Itegeko ry'Impuruza rikora kandi rihuye. Nta rihari, impuruza ziguma mu mateka ariko nta mamenyesha yoherezwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:524
msgid "No rules yet. Create a rule below to start routing alarms to your notification destinations."
msgstr "Nta mategeko arahari. Kora itegeko hasi kugira ngo utangire kuyobora impuruza ku byerekezo byawe by'imenyesha."

#: includes/admin_view.php:533
msgid "Credential values are never loaded into this page. Saving replaces the endpoint record; blank values do not preserve an old password. Use the CLI for protected backup/restore and poller provisioning."
msgstr "Uduciro tw'imyirondoro ntitwigera tupakururwa kuri uru rupapuro. Kubika bisimbuza inyandiko y'iherezo ry'umuyoboro; uduciro turimo ubusa ntitubika ijambobanga rya kera. Koresha CLI kugira ngo ukore kopi y'ububiko/kugarura birinzwe no gutegura poller."

#: includes/admin_view.php:536
msgid "Create endpoint"
msgstr "Kora iherezo ry'umuyoboro"

#: includes/admin_view.php:536
msgid "No REST API or webhook endpoints have been saved. Create an endpoint to enter its bearer token, Basic authentication username and password, or API-key headers."
msgstr "Nta maherezo y'imiyoboro ya REST API cyangwa webhook yabitswe. Kora iherezo ry'umuyoboro kugira ngo winjize tokeni yaryo ya bearer, izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga byo kwemeza kwa Basic, cyangwa imitwe y'urufunguzo rwa API."

#: includes/admin_view.php:540
