#: setup.php:178
msgid "Enter how many days, weeks or months to keep alert history, or choose Indefinitely to keep everything (the number is then ignored). Maximum 3650 days, 520 weeks or 120 months. A purge job runs with the Cacti poller and removes aged events with their decisions, deliveries and attempts. Active conditions and queued or failed work are never purged. Each collector purges its own history."
msgstr "Injiza umubare w'iminsi, ibyumweru cyangwa amezi yo kubika amateka y'impuruza, cyangwa uhitemo Iteka kugira ngo ubike byose (umubare uba wirengagijwe). Ntarenzwa iminsi 3650, ibyumweru 520 cyangwa amezi 120. Umurimo wo gusukura ukorana na poller ya Cacti kandi ugakuraho ibyabaye bishaje hamwe n'ibyemezo, iyohereza n'ibigeragezo byabyo. Imiterere ikora n'imirimo iri ku murongo cyangwa yanze ntibisukurwa na rimwe. Buri kusanya risukura amateka yaryo."

